    "Worksheets"
  ],
  "levelSet": {
    "points": [
      {
        "text": "Just like our bakery cake, fractions help us talk about sharing things fairly, whether it's a piece of fruit or a part of a journey.",
        "detail": "Reiterate the real-world application from the initial scenario."
      },
      {
        "text": "When we say 'half' a glass of water or 'a quarter' of an hour, we are using fractions every day!"
